...\n     \"json\": {\n       // json config goes here\n     },\n     \"plugins\": [\n       \"npm:@dprint/json@0.24.0\"\n     ]\n   }\n   ```\n\n## JS Formatting API\n\n* [JS Formatter](https://github.com/dprint/js-formatter) - Browser/Deno and Node\n* [npm package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@dprint/json)\n\n"}